
# API tests – PT Dashboard

### Hämta snapshot-data
GET http://localhost:5000/dashboard/api/snapshot
Accept: application/json

###

### Hämta alla ordrar
GET http://localhost:5000/dashboard/api/orders
Accept: application/json

###

### Hämta totals per arbetsgrupp
GET http://localhost:5000/dashboard/api/totals
Accept: application/json

###

### Hämta totalall
GET http://localhost:5000/dashboard/api/totalall
Accept: application/json

###

### Hämta användarinformation
GET http://localhost:5000/dashboard/api/me
Accept: application/json

###

### Hälsokontroll
GET http://localhost:5000/dashboard/api/health
Accept: application/json
